OL,3,GNEWSAArran ferry evacuated over 'bomb
OL,4,Athreat' as passenger rescued from sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ferry service on Scotland's west
OL,7,Fcoast has been evacuated over a bomb
OL,8,Fthreat after a passenger was rescued
OL,9,Ffrom the water.
OL,11,FOperator CalMac said a person was
OL,12,Freported overboard on the MV Caledonian
OL,13,FIsles 16:40 sailing from Brodick on the
OL,14,FIsle of Arran.
OL,16,FThe vessel's fast rescue craft was
OL,17,Flaunched to recover the passenger. The
OL,18,FBBC understands that they then claimed
OL,19,Fthere was a bomb on board.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
