OL,3,GNEWSAArran ferry evacuated over 'bomb
OL,4,Athreat' as passenger rescued from sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalMac said emergency protocols were
OL,7,Fput in place. The vessel was searched
OL,8,Fand 329 people were removed on foot
OL,9,Fwhen it berthed at Ardrossan.
